<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dewa 19 — Official Band Fanpage</title>
    
    <!-- LINK EXTERNAL CSS SATELLITE (Sesuai Syarat Tugas) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
    
    <!-- FONTS & ICONS -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;800;900&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0a0b0e;
            --bg-secondary: #13151c;
            --bg-card: #1a1d26;
            --accent-crimson: #d92332;
            --accent-gold: #e5b869;
            --accent-champagne: #f4e8cf;
            --text-main: #f3f4f6;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --border-color: rgba(229, 184, 105, 0.2);
            --glass-bg: rgba(19, 21, 28, 0.88);
            --font-heading: 'Cinzel', serif;
            --font-body: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            background-color: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 15%, rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.08) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 75%, rgba(229, 184, 105, 0.06) 0%, transparent 45%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1.1rem 2rem;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent-crimson);
            text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.5);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.8rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            transition: var(--transition);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover,
        .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            background: rgba(229, 184, 105, 0.1);
        }

        .nav-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn-structure {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-crimson), #991b1b);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: var(--transition);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-structure:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.5);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, var(--accent-crimson));
        }

        .menu-toggle {
            display: none;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            gap: 4rem;
        }

        .hero-content {
            flex: 1.1;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            background: rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.4);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 4rem;
            line-height: 1.08;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #cbd5e1 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-title span {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-gold), #fef08a);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
            max-width: 560px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-gold), #c5933a);
            color: #0b0c10;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 800;
            transition: var(--transition);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(229, 184, 105, 0.25);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(229, 184, 105, 0.4);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fcd34d, var(--accent-gold));
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            transition: var(--transition);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-crimson);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            background: rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.1);
        }

        /* HERO IMAGE CARD WITH LOCAL PROJECT ASSET PATH */
        .hero-image-wrapper {
            flex: 0.9;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .hero-image-card {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),
                        0 0 35px rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.25);
            background: var(--bg-card);
        }

        .hero-image-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 520px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.6s ease;
        }

        .hero-image-card:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.04);
        }

        .hero-image-caption {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(10,11,14,0.98) 0%, rgba(10,11,14,0) 100%);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }

        .artist-tag {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .asset-indicator {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-family: monospace;
        }

        section {
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .section-header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* DISCOGRAPHY & MUSIC PLAYER */
        .grid-albums {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .album-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .album-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            border-color: var(--accent-gold);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }

        .album-cover {
            width: 100%;
            height: 260px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .album-title {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
            color: var(--accent-champagne);
        }

        .album-meta {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .track-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .track-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .track-item i {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .track-item i:hover {
            color: var(--accent-crimson);
            transform: scale(1.25);
        }

        /* TOUR TABLE */
        .tour-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .tour-table th, .tour-table td {
            padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .tour-table th {
            background: rgba(217, 35, 50, 0.15);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .tour-table tr {
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .tour-table tr:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        }

        .btn-ticket {
            padding: 6px 16px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .btn-ticket:hover {
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            color: #000;
        }

        /* GALLERY GRID */
        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .gallery-item {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 250px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .gallery-item img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .gallery-item:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        /* ASSIGNMENT STRUCTURE MODAL */
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            z-index: 2000;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .modal.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        .modal-content {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            max-height: 85vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.95);
        }

        .modal-header {
            padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .modal-header h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn-close {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .btn-close:hover {
            color: #fff;
        }

        .modal-body {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            overflow-y: auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .folder-tree {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            padding: 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: #4ade80;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .file-tabs {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .file-tab {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-family: monospace;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .file-tab.active {
            background: var(--accent-crimson);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .code-viewer {
            background: #08090c;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1rem;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            max-height: 280px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            position: relative;
        }

        .btn-copy {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            right: 10px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-copy:hover {
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            color: #000;
        }

        footer {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .social-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .social-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                padding-top: 2rem;
            }

            .hero-subtitle {
                margin: 0 auto 2.2rem;
            }

            .hero-buttons {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }

            .menu-toggle {
                display: block;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="index.html" class="logo">
                DEWA <span>19</span>
            </a>

            <!-- LINK MENU FILE HTML TERPISAH (SESUAI SYARAT TUGAS) -->
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="index.html" class="active" onclick="switchPage('home', event)">Beranda</a></li>
                <li><a href="pages/about.html" onclick="switchPage('about', event)">Biografi</a></li>
                <li><a href="pages/discography.html" onclick="switchPage('discography', event)">Diskografi</a></li>
                <li><a href="pages/tour.html" onclick="switchPage('tour', event)">Jadwal Konser</a></li>
                <li><a href="pages/gallery.html" onclick="switchPage('gallery', event)">Galeri</a></li>
                <li><a href="pages/contact.html" onclick="switchPage('contact', event)">Fan Club</a></li>
            </ul>

            <div class="nav-actions">
                <button class="btn-structure" onclick="openStructureModal()">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree"></i> Lihat Struktur Tugas
                </button>
                <button class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
        <section class="hero" id="home-view">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown"></i> Legenda Rock Indonesia — 30+ Tahun</span>
                <h1 class="hero-title">Dewa <span>19</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    Grup musik rock paling berpengaruh di Indonesia bentukan Ahmad Dhani sejak 1986. Menghadirkan simfoni mahakarya "Kangen", "Separuh Nafas", "Roman Picisan" & "Cinta Adalah Misteri".
                </p>
                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="#discography" onclick="switchPage('discography', event)" class="btn-primary">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-compact-disc"></i> Dengarkan Diskografi
                    </a>
                    <a href="#tour" onclick="switchPage('tour', event)" class="btn-secondary">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i> Pesta Rakyat Tour 2026
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CONTAINER GAMBAR HERO UTAMA (ASET PROJECT + FALLBACK OLEH SCRIPT) -->
            <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
                <div class="hero-image-card">
                    <!-- Path aset gambar lokal project: assets/images/dewa19_hero.jpg -->
                    <img 
                        src="assets/images/dewa19_hero.jpg" 
                        alt="Dewa 19 Band Portrait"
                        id="hero-image-element"
                        onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511671782779-c97d3d27a1d4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80';"
                    >
                    <div class="hero-image-caption">
                        <div>
                            <div class="artist-tag">DEWA 19 MARESTRO</div>
                            <small style="color: var(--text-muted);">Foto Utama Hero Section</small>
                        </div>
                        <span class="asset-indicator">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-image"></i> assets/images/dewa19_hero.jpg
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="about-section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Sejarah & Biografi Band</h2>
                <p>Perjalanan mahakarya tiga dekade musik tanah air dari Surabaya</p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2.5rem; align-items: stretch;">
                <div style="background: var(--bg-card); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                    <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--accent-gold); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.4rem;">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-record-vinyl"></i> Awal Berdiri (1986)
                    </h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        Dewa 19 dibentuk di Surabaya pada tahun 1986 oleh empat siswa SMPN 6 Surabaya: <strong>Dhani Ahmad, Erwin Prasetya, Wawan Juniarso, dan Andra Junaidi</strong>. Nama DEWA merupakan akronim dari nama depan pendirinya.
                    </p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">
                        Angka '19' ditambahkan saat merilis album debut eponymous pada 1992 karena sebagian besar personil saat itu berusia 19 tahun.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div style="background: var(--bg-card); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                    <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--accent-gold); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.4rem;">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-users-line"></i> Era Vokalis & Formasi
                    </h3>
                    <ul style="list-style: none; color: var(--text-muted);">
                        <li style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-champagne);">Ari Lasso Era (1991–1999):</strong> Meledakkan hits "Kangen", "Aku Milikmu", "Kirana", & "Cinta 'Kan Membawamu".
                        </li>
                        <li style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-champagne);">Once Mekel Era (1999–2011):</strong> Era keemasan album <em>Bintang Lima</em> & <em>Laskar Cinta</em>.
                        </li>
                        <li style="padding: 8px 0;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-champagne);">Pesta Rakyat Era (2021–Present):</strong> Feat. Ello & Virzha merajai stadion tur nusantara.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="discography">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Diskografi Mahakarya</h2>
                <p>Koleksi album studio legendaris yang memecahkan rekor rekam jutaan kopi</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid-albums">
                <!-- ALBUM 1 -->
                <div class="album-card">
                    <img 
                        src="assets/images/album_bintang_lima.jpg" 
                        alt="Bintang Lima Album Cover" 
                        class="album-cover"
